{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944990/extras/DisguiseAround.gif?t=1715627797\" /><br><br>Reality patrol: prologue is third person stealth-action game. Travel through time to different eras to protect history from absurd villains.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944990/extras/Portals.gif?t=1715627797\" /><br><br>Use your sci-fi gadgets and skills to complete your assignment with maximum effectiveness.\tTry to work quietly and cleanly so as not to change human history.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944990/extras/Poison.gif?t=1715627797\" /><br><br>There are multiple ways to complete your objective.<br><br><i>The prologue is only part of the full game and is completely free. Every player will be able to play it and see what awaits them in the full version of the game.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prologue Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Introductory Story</strong> - Experience the beginning of a story. The prologue includes tutorial and first level.<br></li><li><strong>Familiarization</strong> - Get comfortable with the game's controls and mechanics, setting you up for success in the full game.<br></li><li><strong>Visual and Audio Treat</strong> - Enjoy the same high-quality graphics and atmospheric soundtrack as the main game.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2944990?t=1715627797","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2944990?t=1715627797","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944990/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1715627797","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944990/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1715627797","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>\u2728 WISHLIST FULL GAME \u2728</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944990/extras/DisguiseAround.gif?t=1715627797\" /><br><br>Reality patrol: prologue is third person stealth-action game. Travel through time to different eras to protect history from absurd villains.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944990/extras/Portals.gif?t=1715627797\" /><br><br>Use your sci-fi gadgets and skills to complete your assignment with maximum effectiveness.\tTry to work quietly and cleanly so as not to change human history.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944990/extras/Poison.gif?t=1715627797\" /><br><br>There are multiple ways to complete your objective.<br><br><i>The prologue is only part of the full game and is completely free. Every player will be able to play it and see what awaits them in the full version of the game.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prologue Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Introductory Story</strong> - Experience the beginning of a story. The prologue includes tutorial and first level.<br></li><li><strong>Familiarization</strong> - Get comfortable with the game's controls and mechanics, setting you up for success in the full game.<br></li><li><strong>Visual and Audio Treat</strong> - Enjoy the same high-quality graphics and atmospheric soundtrack as the main game.</li></ul>","developers":["Mad Knight"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944990/header.jpg?t=1715627797","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"